  <div class="section-title">Requirements</div>
  <ol style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    <li>A minimum of <span data-field="min_hours_1">{{ min_hours_1 }}</span> semester hours (12 of the last 18 at MTSU) with a 2.0 GPA is required for graduation</li>
    <li>At least <span data-field="min_hours_2">{{ min_hours_2 }}</span> semester hours of 3000 or 4000 level courses (Upper Division) must be completed with an average grade of "<span data-field="min_grade_2">{{ min_grade_2 }}</span>" or better</li>
    <li>At least <span data-field="min_hours_3">{{ min_hours_3 }}</span> of the 42 Upper Division hours must be completed at MTSU</li>
    <li>At least <span data-field="min_hours_4">{{ min_hours_4 }}</span> semester hours of senior college coursework is required</li>
